 "_doc": "Outside SARO along the highway (Exterior.ts) and the motel court (MotelFront.ts) on the same ground. Everything stands outside the walk zones (the shoulder runs x -33.5 to -15 down to the motel, SARO's grounds end at z 34 and x 46), so nothing closes a way; what stands in them blocks as a collider. New Mexico in 1986: a power line on wooden poles down the west side of the highway with a spur over it to SARO, a ranch fence of barbed wire on both sides south of the site, rocks and boulders, brush, yucca and tumbleweed (no Joshua trees), a wreck in the ditch by a broken pole, cliffs on the skyline.",
